Package: ggRootCellAtlas
Title: Visualize the Arabidopsis Root Cell Atlas on Realistic Root Layouts
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Maria", "Savina", role = "aut"),
    person("Victoria", "Mironova", , "victoria.mironova@ru.nl",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Draws a longitudinal section and six cross-sections of the
    Arabidopsis thaliana root, from the meristem to the differentiation zone,
    as one composite figure. Cells can be coloured by cell type, tissue, zone
    or section annotation, or by average gene expression per cell group, for
    example from a single-cell atlas analysed with Seurat. Built on
    'ggPlantmap' and 'ggplot2'.
